    "🧠 Generate Full Audit Report Using Lily Cybersecurity LLaMA Model\n",
    "\n",
    "This section uses the Lily-Cybersecurity-7B v0.2 model to generate a comprehensive audit report by analyzing both SOC documentation and security logs.\n",
    "🔐 Key Workflow:\n",
    "\n",
    "    📦 Install Dependencies and Load Model\n",
    "\n",
    "        Downloads the quantized lily-cybersecurity-7b-v0.2 GGUF model from Hugging Face.\n",
    "\n",
    "        Configured with optimized settings for CPU inference (reduced context and batch size).\n",
    "\n",
    "    📁 Load Input Data\n",
    "\n",
    "        Reads pre-summarized documentation (doc_summaries.txt) and logs (log_summaries.txt).\n",
    "\n",
    "        Each log entry is separated by a newline for easier parsing.\n",
    "\n",
    "    🧾 Define Instruction Prompt\n",
    "\n",
    "        Uses a detailed multi-part instruction under [INST]...[/INST] format.\n",
    "\n",
    "        Tasks include:\n",
    "\n",
    "            Event and risk identification\n",
    "\n",
    "            SOC process review\n",
    "\n",
    "            Compliance gap detection (e.g., NIST 800-53)\n",
    "\n",
    "            C2M2-based maturity rating\n",
    "\n",
    "            Structured audit report generation\n",
    "\n",
    "    📤 Prepare Final Prompt\n",
    "\n",
    "        Combines SOC documentation and 2 sample logs into a full prompt\n",
    "\n",
    "        Automatically tokenizes input and checks token count to avoid overflow\n",
    "\n",
    "    🤖 Generate the Audit Report\n",
    "\n",
    "        Uses the model to produce a structured report with sections like:\n",
    "\n",
    "            Executive Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "            Detailed Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "            Compliance\n",
    "\n",
    "            Maturity Assessment\n",
    "\n",
    "        The response is returned inside a custom XML-like <xaiArtifact> tag (with artifact_id, title, and contentType)\n",
    "\n",
    "This step produces a high-level audit report ideal for stakeholders, auditors, or compliance teams to quickly understand detection posture, vulnerabilities, and SOC maturity."
