    "\n",
    "**Input Data**:\n",
    "{report_content}\n",
    "{report_content1}\n",
    "{report_content2}\n",
    "\n",
    "Input Data: [Input placeholder: The preliminary SOC audit report content, including logs showing failed password attempts, unauthorized root access attempts, detection gaps, weak password policies, compliance violations, and a low SOC maturity level.]\n",
